			y: -4.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: [
				"313924AB9668D115"
				"0878B7E97A3C7732"
			]
			description: [
				"An incredible upgrade to your singleblock Macerator, this bad boy can do recipes 8 at a time with incredible power effieciency and much higher speed on &otop&r of the parallel capabilities. You'd be doing yourself a disservice by not making at least one of these."
				""
				"In terms of raw speed, this macerator does not get outpaced by any singleblock macerator until &5EV&r."
			]
			id: "7B67B5ED5CF38D6D"
			optional: true
			tasks: [{
				id: "76A8932C0961A20F"
				item: "gtceu:steam_grinder"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: 6.5d
			y: -5.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: [
				"65B80C6980091FA7"
				"7B67B5ED5CF38D6D"
			]
			description: [
				"Creating these two multiblocks allows you to reasonably create your first Ore Processing system."
				"GregTech ore processing is a complex topic, one which could not be explained in a single quest, and you currently do not have access to a majority of it anyways, but as of right now, you can create a simple setup to double the amount of material you get per ore."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Putting ore in a Macerator gives you double the yield that you otherwise would in Crushed ore. For ores such as Iron or Copper that are smelted into ingots, this crushed ore can be slammed directly into a furnace to smelt them as if they were ore. If you automate this process, you will have a system that accepts ore from your increasingly bulky mining trips, and turns them into a ton of materials, all without any input from you."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:crushed_iron_ore"
			id: "47D2A6FF3BC4861C"
			optional: true
			tasks: [{
				id: "75C4A86F9108EF14"
				title: "Ore Processing"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			x: 5.0d
			y: -4.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5C4AB4A662495496"]
			description: ["The &bGregTech&r logistics system is comprised of two things, Item/Fluid pipes and Covers. The following quests go into more detail."]
			icon: "gtceu:lv_robot_arm"
			id: "27C583BEDD47FC27"
			size: 1.25d
			subtitle: "Budget AE2"
			tasks: [{
				id: "425E88C2C512C921"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "GregTech Logistics and the Cover System"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 2.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["140D720919268B58"]
			description: ["Tin Item Pipes are your first item pipes. These remain useful for much longer than the Fluid Pipes you can obtain at this point."]
			id: "52D8AE8B55A61825"
			tasks: [{
				id: "56534E9C1C55C19C"
				item: "gtceu:tin_small_item_pipe"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: -2.5d
			y: 3.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["140D720919268B58"]
			description: ["Bronze fluid pipes are cheap to make and effective for transporting the amount of Steam you'll be making early on."]
			id: "625F969ADE53B17E"
			tasks: [{
				id: "0E1520612FBFC289"
				item: "gtceu:bronze_small_fluid_pipe"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: -2.5d
			y: 2.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["140D720919268B58"]
			description: ["Potin is a material made from 6 parts Copper, 2 parts Tin, and 1 part Lead. This (for the Copper and Tin), is the same effective cost as making Bronze, but these fluid pipes have double the throughput as compared to Bronze."]
			id: "34930FFE12A96F52"
			optional: true
			tasks: [{
				id: "5200E66A7C9F972D"
				item: "gtceu:potin_normal_fluid_pipe"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: -3.5d
			y: 2.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["27C583BEDD47FC27"]
			description: [
				"&cCovers&r are &bGregTech&r items that can be placed on the sides of other &bGregTech blocks&r. This most commonly takes the form of Conveyors or Pumps that can push or pull items or fluids."
				""
				"Thanks to the &6ULV Covers&r addon, Steam Age versions of these items are available. You likely wont need many right now, and they are predictably weaker than the ones found later in the game, but they're dirt cheap and can work in a pinch even later on."
			]
			id: "3F58D481792D21C9"
			optional: true
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "58DF5840E7D1EEE8"
					item: "ulvcovm:ulv_electric_motor"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "7DDA2BC361AF90CB"
					item: "ulvcovm:ulv_electric_piston"
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			title: "Covers"
			x: 1.5d
			y: 3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3F58D481792D21C9"]
			description: ["The ULV Pump can push or pull 32 millibuckets of fluid per tick."]
			id: "1C7298DD4BF69F36"
			optional: true
			tasks: [{
				id: "25797143BC51951D"
				item: "ulvcovm:ulv_electric_pump"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: 2.5d
			y: 3.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3F58D481792D21C9"]
			description: ["The ULV Conveyor is a conveyor that can move 2 items per second"]
			id: "6D6B1E14F574D998"
			optional: true
			tasks: [{
				id: "52D256581D89FC61"
				item: "ulvcovm:ulv_conveyor_module"
