		{
			dependencies: ["03603AED6CDBC2F0"]
			description: [
				"The tools you made out of &0Flint&r in the first chapter can also be made out of the stronger materials detailed in the previous quest. On top of this, there are Mining Hammers and Spades. These are pickaxes and shovels respectively that mine in a 3x3 area surrounding the block that you target. This will be basically mandatory as your resource requirements increase."
				"Also, the Crowbar is used to remove Covers from &bGregTech&r blocks."
